                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "More like [strike]RoboMobileware[/strike] a match 3 game from a Mobile app. The versus A.I mode does make it somewhat unique, but the concept and gameplay stays the same. Round after round you match 3+ of the same tiles, until enemy dies, to win. 83 is an awful lot of lvls for defeating only 5 enemies. There should’ve been a larger cast, and more abilities. The gameplay isn’t too long, but was glitchy af, which made the progression slow. FPS is bad, and at one match, the enemy was bugged. I had to restart the game. \n\nThe Menu did provide some helpful options like Load game, and language - The latter would explain the poor English translations in-game. There’s also a tutorial, though superfluous since the game is self-explanatory.  \n\nThe graphic looks like a bunch of Unity Assets, and the tiles and effects (I.e Thumbs up when you complete a lvl) all looks like clipart ripped off from the web. Skip Robomatch, and find another Match 3 game that can run properly at least.",
